        s3t: '3. How we use the data',
        s3i1: 'Operating user accounts and authentication',
        s3i2: 'Displaying leaderboards and game statistics',
        s3i3: 'Improving the app based on anonymized data',
        s3i4: 'Sending important app notifications (not marketing)',
        s4t: '4. How we protect data', s4b: 'Your data is stored in a secure cloud database (Supabase). Access to data is protected with Row Level Security — each user can see only their own data.',
